3
00:01:02.401 --> 00:01:06.401
Street-talk translation

4
00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:07.650
CAPE FEAR RIVER

5
00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.511
I'm looking for Robert Cady.

6
00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.645
Is this seat taken?
-Yeah. ma'am.

7
00:02:25.395 --> 00:02:26.813
Follow me.

8
00:02:39.117 --> 00:02:40.517
That's him right there.

9
00:02:47.543 --> 00:02:48.943
Max's lawyer.

10
00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:56.134
Let me guess.
You were just in the neighborhood and got lost?

11
00:02:57.594 --> 00:02:58.994
I'm looking for Crystal.

12
00:03:09.314 --> 00:03:10.714
Is that so?

13
00:03:13.777 --> 00:03:17.614
Who's that?
-Little Anna Deveraux. Mama.

14
00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:22.577
What's she doing here? Do they know about Crystal?

15
00:03:22.578 --> 00:03:28.792
Chill out. Don't stress.
Everything's cool.

16
00:03:31.503 --> 00:03:37.383
Here's Crystal.
-There's my baby. Yep.

17
00:03:37.384 --> 00:03:41.805
Here you go. sweetie. Good girl.

18
00:03:44.266 --> 00:03:49.605
Just tell me where she is. and I'm out.
-Leave Crystal alone.

19
00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:54.650
That girl's been fighting her demons
her whole damn life.

20
00:03:54.651 --> 00:03:58.651
If you mess with her.
I promise you'll regret it.

21
00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:03.041
You better bounce. lady.

22
00:04:09.625 --> 00:04:11.025
Fine.

23
00:04:16.964 --> 00:04:19.301
Nothing to see here.

24
00:04:28.477 --> 00:04:30.610
There's nothing for you here.

25
00:04:52.751 --> 00:04:56.338
I got a few things to take care of...

26
00:04:58.382 --> 00:05:01.468
and then I'll catch up with you guys.

27
00:05:26.118 --> 00:05:30.539
Know this girl? Crystal Cady.
-Nah.

28
00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:35.523
But you know the family. right?
They live down the street.

29
00:05:37.004 --> 00:05:39.337
Are you a paying customer or what?

30
00:05:45.387 --> 00:05:48.390
Whatever. it doesn't even matter now.

31
00:05:49.641 --> 00:05:51.643
Whiskey. Neat.

32
00:06:46.156 --> 00:06:47.556
Ha. sunshine.

33
00:06:48.617 --> 00:06:50.494
I heard you were looking for me.

34
00:07:19.481 --> 00:07:22.191
BASED ON JOHN D. MACDONALD'S
'THE EXECUTIONERS'

35
00:07:22.192 --> 00:07:23.359
BASED ON THE ‘CAPE FEAR’ FILMS

36
00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:26.227
TELEPLAY BY WESLEY STRICK
AND JAMES R. WEBB

37
00:07:34.538 --> 00:07:37.499
Hello?
-Hey. kiddo.

38
00:07:46.175 --> 00:07:51.138
Zack? Is that you?
-Yeah. it's me.

39
00:07:55.851 --> 00:07:57.251
How's it going?

40
00:07:58.437 --> 00:08:03.108
Pretty good. How are you guys doing?

41
00:08:05.402 --> 00:08:07.237
Taking it one day at a time.

42
00:08:08.447 --> 00:08:09.865
We miss you.

43
00:08:11.241 --> 00:08:12.641
I wanna go home.

44
00:08:14.953 --> 00:08:18.498
I know. bud. That's gonna happen.
Soon.

45
00:08:21.168 --> 00:08:25.881
Just gotta hang in there a bit longer.
Then we'll all be back home together.

46
00:08:28.592 --> 00:08:31.011
Group therapy is starting.

47
00:08:32.888 --> 00:08:34.765
I gotta hang up.
-Zack...

48
00:08:51.406 --> 00:08:52.806
Hand over your cookie.

49
00:08:55.744 --> 00:08:59.748
What?
-You're not gonna eat it. Hand it over.

50
00:09:01.834 --> 00:09:04.336
Maybe I am.
-For real?

51
00:09:07.548 --> 00:09:09.748
I bet you won't even eat it.

52
00:09:10.592 --> 00:09:13.525
Everyone knows
she's gonna kick your ass.

53
00:09:14.304 --> 00:09:20.352
She's just making you wait so me
and everyone else here can get you first.

54
00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.653
Just hand me the damn cookie.

55
00:09:28.652 --> 00:09:30.052
Drop dead.

56
00:09:32.739 --> 00:09:35.158
Damn.
-Get her.

57
00:09:37.703 --> 00:09:39.538
Weak-ass white girl.

58
00:09:51.091 --> 00:09:55.136
She's mine.
-Shut your trap. Damn.

59
00:09:55.137 --> 00:09:56.555
Stay down. Cool.

60
00:10:26.543 --> 00:10:28.628
POLICE MISSED CALL
NOA 4 MESSAGES

61
00:10:28.629 --> 00:10:33.696
WHERE ARE YOU? TOM AND I ARE TRYING TO
REACH YOU. WORKING ON NATALIE'S BAIL. CALL.

62
00:10:38.013 --> 00:10:44.769
Noa. I'm totally fine.
This sounds mad crazy. I'm with Crystal Cady.

63
00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:49.399
Look up everything you can find on her.
I'll do the same.

64
00:10:50.901 --> 00:10:55.906
Tell Tom I'll make it up to him. okay?

65
00:11:13.924 --> 00:11:15.324
Okay.

66
00:11:34.069 --> 00:11:36.363
Well. good morning. princess.

67
00:11:39.741 --> 00:11:40.741
Morning.

68
00:11:40.742 --> 00:11:44.475
Hope my humble abode
was up to your standards.

69
00:11:45.163 --> 00:11:46.563
I survived.

70
00:11:48.834 --> 00:11:50.234
Beer?

71
00:11:52.796 --> 00:11:54.196
Thanks.

72
00:11:59.761 --> 00:12:02.973
Did you learn that trick
from your college girlhood friends?

73
00:12:06.602 --> 00:12:11.202
Who says I learned it from them?
Maybe it was the other way around.

74
00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.527
Maybe I taught their boyfriends
and they taught theirs.

75
00:12:16.528 --> 00:12:18.071
You got a big mouth.

76
00:12:20.824 --> 00:12:22.224
Where's my piece?

77
00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:25.060
Stashed safely away.

78
00:12:29.541 --> 00:12:30.941
So...

79
00:12:32.085 --> 00:12:34.152
tell me about you and Max.

80
00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:39.450
You first.

81
00:12:42.846 --> 00:12:45.349
Bowden. you got a visitor.

82
00:13:12.417 --> 00:13:16.338
You look super impressive.

83
00:13:17.965 --> 00:13:21.884
Made any friends in here yet?
I'm low-key worried about you.

84
00:13:21.885 --> 00:13:25.680
What do your fellow inmates
think of prosecutors?

85
00:13:25.681 --> 00:13:29.767
They're not huge fans. right?
Or do they not know yet?

86
00:13:29.768 --> 00:13:34.105
They don't know yet.
Well. they're gonna find out soon enough.

87
00:13:34.106 --> 00:13:39.819
Are you just here to be annoying
or you got something useful to say?

88
00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:43.197
Yeah. actually I do.
I gotta tell you something major.

89
00:13:43.198 --> 00:13:48.536
Save all your Kikkoman soy sauce packets...

90
00:13:48.537 --> 00:13:50.288
from the mess hall.

91
00:13:50.289 --> 00:13:54.584
Cuz if you mix the soy sauce
with mayo. you get this sauce...

92
00:13:54.585 --> 00:13:57.718
that makes literally any meal slap.
-Go to hell.

93
00:13:57.921 --> 00:14:01.591
It's so good.

94
00:14:01.592 --> 00:14:02.992
Sorry. sir.

95
00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:05.470
You're gonna wanna hear this.

96
00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:16.607
How's it feel. Tom?

97
00:14:18.025 --> 00:14:19.425
Sitting in that spot?

98
00:14:21.111 --> 00:14:26.115
You need permission
to eat. sleep. or take a dump.

99
00:14:26.116 --> 00:14:28.316
You need permission for everything.

100
00:14:29.536 --> 00:14:35.500
How does it feel realizing
you've completely...

101
00:14:35.501 --> 00:14:39.378
lost all control and agency
to do what you want when you want?

102
00:14:39.379 --> 00:14:43.175
You don't got that there. do you?
That's gotta blow.

103
00:14:45.177 --> 00:14:51.225
But I'm gonna give you the chance to
be the man your family actually needs.

104
00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:57.188
One of my boys is having a little
present dropped off in your cell today.

105
00:14:57.189 --> 00:14:58.589
So...

106
00:15:00.234 --> 00:15:01.400
a little present.

107
00:15:01.401 --> 00:15:02.801
Right in your cell.

108
00:15:04.571 --> 00:15:06.171
It's gonna be your saving grace.

109
00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:19.658
Sounds like he totally screwed you over.

110
00:15:21.255 --> 00:15:23.799
Rined your whole life.

111
00:15:24.383 --> 00:15:25.983
Wrecked your family.

112
00:15:26.969 --> 00:15:28.369
Classic Max.

113
00:15:29.471 --> 00:15:35.561
That must've sucked.
but you must've been super into him. right?

114
00:15:37.271 --> 00:15:41.899
No. duh. Like I said
about what you saw... He kissed me...

115
00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:44.528
Against your will.
-Yeah. against my will.

116
00:15:45.112 --> 00:15:47.239
Didn't look like it.

117
00:15:48.031 --> 00:15:53.745
What about you? Why are you following him.
stalking him. snapping pics?

118
00:15:54.329 --> 00:15:56.729
I feel like you're low-key obsessed with him.

119
00:15:57.541 --> 00:15:59.542
I am not obsessed with him.

120
00:15:59.543 --> 00:16:04.130
It's because I know Max Cady
and I know what he's up to.

121
00:16:04.131 --> 00:16:05.715
That's why I got those pics.

122
00:16:05.716 --> 00:16:11.513
As long as he knows I got proof
of his shady stuff. he leaves me alone.

123
00:16:12.014 --> 00:16:15.281
And no. you can't see 'em.
cause they're mine.

124
00:16:17.144 --> 00:16:18.544
What about Amy?

125
00:16:19.479 --> 00:16:22.565
And Melissa? What'd he do to them?

126
00:16:22.566 --> 00:16:27.613
I'm just saying
that when Max wants something done...

127
00:16:28.322 --> 00:16:30.189
he makes sure it happens.

128
00:16:30.657 --> 00:16:33.524
He makes people
do whatever he wants.

129
00:16:34.161 --> 00:16:35.561
“Whatever” as in...

130
00:16:36.747 --> 00:16:38.147
offing themselves?

131
00:16:39.541 --> 00:16:42.274
Amy Brancato moved up to Asheville.

132
00:16:42.753 --> 00:16:46.088
She got a new boo and was rebuilding her life...

133
00:16:46.089 --> 00:16:48.925
and then Max showed up and that was all it took.

134
00:16:48.926 --> 00:16:52.261
She came back here and ended up staying
with her stepmom again.

135
00:16:52.262 --> 00:16:54.681
That's where she was when they found her.

136
00:16:57.392 --> 00:16:58.792
What else you know?

137
00:17:36.139 --> 00:17:40.393
I gave her a little taste. She knows
I'm gonna make her life a living hell.

138
00:17:40.394 --> 00:17:43.856
I'm so lucky to have you. My little girl.

139
00:17:45.607 --> 00:17:47.274
I can do more for you.

140
00:17:49.736 --> 00:17:53.531
When I'm with you. You figure out how to get me out yet?

141
00:17:53.532 --> 00:17:58.399
Nevaeh. you're my eyes and ears.
I need you. You can't leave yet.

142
00:17:58.871 --> 00:18:01.122
You said you'd get me out soon.
-And I will.

143
00:18:01.123 --> 00:18:03.499
I need one more thing.

144
00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:09.089
I need you to get Natalie to spill
where her mom is.

145
00:18:10.549 --> 00:18:13.718
Can you do that for me?
-Yeah.

146
00:18:13.719 --> 00:18:15.888
Sweet. Awesome.

147
00:18:17.139 --> 00:18:20.475
And then... you finish it.

148
00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.860
Am I supposed to off Natalie?

149
00:18:25.397 --> 00:18:26.397
For real?

150
00:18:26.398 --> 00:18:31.320
Before Anna dies.
she needs to know what it feels like...

151
00:18:32.988 --> 00:18:34.655
to lose a kid.

152
00:18:35.866 --> 00:18:37.266
Just like me.

153
00:18:38.327 --> 00:18:39.727
She gotta feel that.

154
00:18:40.704 --> 00:18:44.666
Think about what she did to me.
what she did to you.

155
00:18:44.791 --> 00:18:48.791
We could've had sixteen years together. Father and daughter.

156
00:18:49.129 --> 00:18:53.466
Can you do that for me?
Then I'll be super proud.

157
00:18:53.467 --> 00:18:55.334
And then you'll get me out of here...

158
00:18:56.345 --> 00:18:57.745
right?

159
00:19:00.766 --> 00:19:04.853
Right? Dad?

160
00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:11.944
Yeah. I love you so much.

161
00:19:12.528 --> 00:19:16.490
Bye. Love you.
-Bye.

162
00:19:35.968 --> 00:19:37.718
Why'd you step in?

163
00:19:37.719 --> 00:19:41.931
Same reason I save tuna from the mess hall. Savoring it for later.

164
00:19:41.932 --> 00:19:43.332
Don't.

165
00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.520
You opened up to me.
We know that was real.

166
00:19:47.521 --> 00:19:52.150
That's called acting. babe.
Or'd you forget I was hooking up with your bro?

167
00:20:03.537 --> 00:20:07.290
Amy's stepmom Brenda is awesome.

168
00:20:07.291 --> 00:20:12.296
She had a pet raccoon for a bit.
till one of the neighbors ran it over.

169
00:20:13.964 --> 00:20:17.633
Damn. Have you never driven before?
-It's no big deal.

170
00:20:17.634 --> 00:20:24.432
I spun around 16 times blindfolded once. I was dared.

171
00:20:24.433 --> 00:20:28.020
I was like 12 beers deep.
but still did it.

172
00:20:30.439 --> 00:20:35.527
This is her place. Hope Brenda's here.

173
00:20:42.868 --> 00:20:45.537
How'd you get that scar on your face?

174
00:20:45.662 --> 00:20:50.918
Broke out of the psych ward
and face-planted into a doorframe.

175
00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:56.047
For real?
-Yeah. Shit was intense.

176
00:20:56.048 --> 00:21:00.781
I dated a guard once.
Made breaking out way easier.

177
00:21:02.513 --> 00:21:05.724
What? I'm hot.
-Yeah. And completely psycho.

178
00:21:07.518 --> 00:21:10.938
Yeah. well. you should know.

179
00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:04.230
Did Max make you do all this stuff?

180
00:22:14.251 --> 00:22:15.651
He...

181
00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:22.758
he made me break into your place. dose your tea with acid...

182
00:22:22.759 --> 00:22:27.806
and seduce your brother
and make him chew off his own toe.

183
00:22:34.980 --> 00:22:39.180
He didn't tell me to mess with you. though. That was all me.

184
00:22:43.864 --> 00:22:45.949
What does he want you to do now?

185
00:22:49.286 --> 00:22:51.086
He wants me to off you.

186
00:22:53.415 --> 00:22:57.282
He's not gonna stop
till your whole family is completely wrecked.

187
00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:00.720
Yeah. well.
he can't get to you here.

188
00:23:02.424 --> 00:23:05.469
My mom can help.
We can go to the cops.

189
00:23:05.594 --> 00:23:09.127
I'm not gonna off you.
but I'm not betraying Max either.

190
00:23:18.565 --> 00:23:20.816
Well. looks like nobody's home.

191
00:23:20.817 --> 00:23:26.865
Brenda sometimes works at the beach shop.
We can go check it out.

192
00:23:32.204 --> 00:23:33.604
Is that Amy's trailer?

193
00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:36.907
Where she shot herself?

194
00:23:41.380 --> 00:23:45.258
Wait. We're probably not allowed there.
It's a crime scene.

195
00:23:45.259 --> 00:23:47.792
Chill. I'm just gonna peep real quick.

196
00:23:49.179 --> 00:23:50.579
Man...

197
00:23:51.974 --> 00:23:53.507
this feels super sketch.

198
00:23:55.185 --> 00:23:57.185
Wait.
-Nah. it's cool.

199
00:23:59.189 --> 00:24:00.922
The police tape's already ripped down.

200
00:24:51.909 --> 00:24:53.309
MELISSA CADY FOUND

201
00:25:06.757 --> 00:25:09.176
That's you. With Amy.

202
00:25:10.761 --> 00:25:16.433
Were you and Amy Brancato friends?
-We knew each other.

203
00:25:24.399 --> 00:25:25.799
Who's this?

204
00:25:27.903 --> 00:25:31.073
The dude. With the scar. In the pic?

205
00:25:33.575 --> 00:25:36.828
That one.
-We're not supposed to be here.

206
00:27:05.000 --> 00:27:07.002
UNKNOWN NUMBER

207
00:27:08.128 --> 00:27:10.923
Did you get my little present?

208
00:27:12.174 --> 00:27:13.574
Drop dead.

209
00:27:13.884 --> 00:27:15.284
Do it...

210
00:27:17.304 --> 00:27:21.304
and your kids will be totally fine.
-I'm not offing myself.

211
00:27:21.475 --> 00:27:22.517
Buck up.

212
00:27:22.518 --> 00:27:27.021
You can't touch my kids.
-Natalie's trapped with Nevaeh...

213
00:27:27.022 --> 00:27:33.862
and Zack's on the second floor
in the east wing.

214
00:27:34.905 --> 00:27:36.532
For now. anyway.

215
00:27:38.992 --> 00:27:40.076
That's total bullshit.

216
00:27:40.077 --> 00:27:43.277
I don't wanna punish your kids
for your mistakes.

217
00:27:43.664 --> 00:27:48.085
That boy's like a son to me.

218
00:27:50.337 --> 00:27:52.256
And your daughter...

219
00:27:54.007 --> 00:27:56.176
well. our daughter.

220
00:27:58.470 --> 00:28:01.348
Listen. enough is enough. I'm giving you...

221
00:28:02.307 --> 00:28:04.476
a chance to make things right.

222
00:28:05.269 --> 00:28:06.669
Father to father.

223
00:28:07.187 --> 00:28:10.941
Take back control. Tom.
Save Zack and Natalie.

224
00:28:12.234 --> 00:28:14.301
Wouldn't your brother do the exact same thing?

225
00:28:22.077 --> 00:28:26.914
Go to hell. Just drop dead. Max.
I'm gonna kill you.

226
00:28:26.915 --> 00:28:30.085
I swear to God I'm gonna hunt you down and kill you.

227
00:28:32.296 --> 00:28:33.696
Whatever.

228
00:28:42.264 --> 00:28:43.664
Max...

229
00:28:44.391 --> 00:28:48.191
told a story
about a girl named Lila...

230
00:28:48.478 --> 00:28:50.811
that he seduced and messed up.

231
00:28:51.732 --> 00:28:54.026
Crystal Delilah Cady.

232
00:28:55.694 --> 00:28:57.227
That's your name. Was that you?

233
00:29:00.908 --> 00:29:03.994
Is that kid in the photo your son?

234
00:29:07.414 --> 00:29:08.814
Yours and Max's?

235
00:29:10.042 --> 00:29:14.837
You don't know shit.
-What happened to him? Is he...

236
00:29:14.838 --> 00:29:19.551
I put him up for adoption. What'd you think?
I didn't have my life together.

237
00:29:21.220 --> 00:29:23.020
I'm not talking about this.

238
00:29:25.474 --> 00:29:30.229
You ain't winning him back.
You got nothing he wants.

239
00:29:33.732 --> 00:29:36.693
Wait. Can I be straight with you?

240
00:29:39.571 --> 00:29:42.904
I've been here before.
I broke in...

241
00:29:43.784 --> 00:29:48.330
cause Amy said Max...

242
00:29:48.914 --> 00:29:54.377
would talk to her every night and she'd fall asleep listening to his voice.

243
00:29:54.378 --> 00:29:57.797
So I went looking
and found recordings of them.

244
00:29:57.798 --> 00:30:03.554
There're recordings?
-Yeah. all on a thumb drive.

245
00:30:04.429 --> 00:30:08.392
Where are they?
-On the boat.

246
00:30:10.853 --> 00:30:12.728
You gotta file those motions on time.

247
00:30:12.729 --> 00:30:16.023
So get your act together...
-She's on the phone.

248
00:30:16.024 --> 00:30:19.653
She's not staying locked up this weekend.
-Hey. Noa.

249
00:30:21.196 --> 00:30:22.596
I'll call you back.

250
00:30:24.366 --> 00:30:27.494
Hope. give us a sec.
-You sure? I...

251
00:30:28.954 --> 00:30:30.354
How's it going?

252
00:30:31.874 --> 00:30:34.542
What do you want. Max?
-A friend. honestly.

253
00:30:34.543 --> 00:30:40.423
Cause I thought Anna regretted
having me locked up. And Tom too.

254
00:30:40.424 --> 00:30:46.138
But nope. they tried to frame me. And honestly? I don't get it.

255
00:30:46.722 --> 00:30:51.351
So you're here looking for some sympathy?
-Yeah. Pretty much.

256
00:30:52.227 --> 00:30:54.021
Cause I...

257
00:30:55.898 --> 00:30:59.401
I'm trying to figure out...
Do you think maybe...

258
00:30:59.526 --> 00:31:00.943
Nah. never mind.

259
00:31:00.944 --> 00:31:03.280
What?
-No. do you think maybe...

260
00:31:04.615 --> 00:31:08.577
Anna didn't even know what Tom was up to?

261
00:31:09.745 --> 00:31:13.916
That would actually make me feel a lot better.
Do you think that's true?

262
00:31:15.083 --> 00:31:16.483
Let me guess.

263
00:31:16.752 --> 00:31:20.338
You want to know where she is
so you can go ask her yourself?

264
00:31:20.339 --> 00:31:23.592
Yeah. That would be ideal. Noa. yeah.

265
00:31:25.010 --> 00:31:30.390
Do you think I'm stupid enough
to tell you where she is?

266
00:31:32.434 --> 00:31:35.567
I was stupid enough
to let you into our lives...

267
00:31:35.938 --> 00:31:40.818
so you could murder my friend Ray and terrorize my friend Anna.

268
00:31:40.943 --> 00:31:46.323
I'm gonna kick myself over that till the day I die.
but I see right through you now.

269
00:31:48.200 --> 00:31:50.202
I'm not scared of you.

270
00:31:51.119 --> 00:31:55.998
I've gone toe-to-toe with the state of Georgia and the U.S. government...

271
00:31:55.999 --> 00:32:01.505
and I can definitely handle Max Cady's lame ass.

272
00:32:03.423 --> 00:32:07.177
I missed that. Can I get the address where Anna is?

273
00:32:19.690 --> 00:32:21.157
Where the hell is Anna?

274
00:32:28.323 --> 00:32:29.723
Noa?

275
00:32:30.534 --> 00:32:34.413
Where the hell is Anna?

276
00:32:41.920 --> 00:32:43.964
Actually. whatever.

277
00:32:45.966 --> 00:32:48.766
Catch you later.
You're looking fire.

278
00:32:51.054 --> 00:32:52.454
Thanks.

279
00:32:57.686 --> 00:33:01.774
Oak Grove Psychiatric Hospital.
-Tom Bowden here. I'm trying to—

280
00:33:01.899 --> 00:33:03.609
One sec. I'll grab him.

281
00:33:06.069 --> 00:33:09.947
Mr. Bowden? Hello. We've been trying to get a hold of you and your wife.

282
00:33:09.948 --> 00:33:12.481
There's been an incident.

283
00:33:13.702 --> 00:33:16.204
What kind of incident?
I need to talk to my son.

284
00:33:16.205 --> 00:33:19.749
Yeah. I'm not totally sure how. but he slipped past security...

285
00:33:19.750 --> 00:33:23.461
and we haven't been able to find him anywhere nearby.

286
00:33:23.462 --> 00:33:27.590
Maybe someone gave him a ride or he had help—

287
00:33:27.591 --> 00:33:29.467
You absolute idiot.
-If this—

288
00:33:29.468 --> 00:33:31.053
He's got my son.

289
00:33:32.221 --> 00:33:33.621
CALLING...
BATTERY 5%

290
00:33:34.014 --> 00:33:38.559
Jared. hit me back. Zack's missing. I think Max took him.

291
00:33:38.560 --> 00:33:41.145
Let me know if Natalie's safe. okay?

292
00:33:41.146 --> 00:33:43.481
Call me back. My phone's about to die.

293
00:33:43.482 --> 00:33:45.942
As soon as you hear this. Noa.
By any means necessary.

294
00:33:45.943 --> 00:33:48.143
Leave a message after the beep.

295
00:33:49.530 --> 00:33:50.930
It's me.

296
00:33:52.991 --> 00:33:54.952
I don't know where you are...

297
00:33:56.203 --> 00:33:58.070
or where the kids are.

298
00:33:59.623 --> 00:34:01.023
I love you.

299
00:34:31.905 --> 00:34:33.305
Your girl is free.

300
00:34:38.161 --> 00:34:41.164
No. Natalie.

301
00:34:42.958 --> 00:34:43.957
What'd you do?

302
00:34:43.958 --> 00:34:47.503
Wait. what'd you do?

303
00:34:47.504 --> 00:34:49.754
Wait. Don't leave.

304
00:34:49.755 --> 00:34:54.428
Don't leave. Wait. Drop dead.

305
00:35:03.228 --> 00:35:05.522
So where are these recordings then?

306
00:35:07.357 --> 00:35:11.737
Right there. You gotta pop the hatch open.

307
00:35:13.155 --> 00:35:14.822
It's kind of heavy. but...

308
00:35:15.782 --> 00:35:18.660
And then. yeah. Like that. yeah.

309
00:35:20.204 --> 00:35:25.209
There's a few boxes. Pretty sure it's the one on the bottom right.

310
00:35:28.754 --> 00:35:32.381
Can't you just point it out?
-You scared of tight spaces?

311
00:35:32.382 --> 00:35:36.449
I know. It's—
-Nah. I just need you to show me.

312
00:35:41.600 --> 00:35:43.000
Okay.

313
00:35:43.727 --> 00:35:45.127
Looking for this?

314
00:35:55.781 --> 00:35:58.114
Why were you wearing Melissa's necklace?

315
00:35:59.910 --> 00:36:02.371
What necklace?
-Come on.

316
00:36:03.247 --> 00:36:05.847
No clue...
-I saw you rocking it.

317
00:36:07.876 --> 00:36:10.838
What did you do?
-I dunno.

318
00:36:12.673 --> 00:36:14.073
Did you off her?

319
00:36:15.008 --> 00:36:16.608
Did you murder Melissa?

320
00:36:20.222 --> 00:36:22.558
I totally get it.

321
00:36:23.767 --> 00:36:27.688
For real. I mean. he was so good to her.

322
00:36:30.023 --> 00:36:31.423
And you were just...

323
00:36:33.193 --> 00:36:34.593
trash.

324
00:36:39.366 --> 00:36:41.743
She didn't deserve that life.

325
00:36:44.830 --> 00:36:46.230
So?

326
00:36:53.088 --> 00:36:54.488
Get down in the hold.

327
00:37:07.477 --> 00:37:09.897
Anna.

328
00:37:10.981 --> 00:37:12.983
Hello. Where are you?

329
00:37:14.568 --> 00:37:18.821
I know you didn't kill Melissa. You didn't murder your wife.

330
00:37:18.822 --> 00:37:22.701
That's right.
Amy Brancato iced Melissa. yeah.

331
00:37:23.702 --> 00:37:28.502
I know you made Amy confess. but not because you were guilty.

332
00:37:28.999 --> 00:37:30.399
Okay.

333
00:37:30.792 --> 00:37:33.837
So who actually killed Melissa?

334
00:37:35.380 --> 00:37:36.780
Crystal.

335
00:37:39.009 --> 00:37:43.942
No. Crystal was locked up in a psych ward.
-Nah. A guard let Crystal walk.

336
00:37:46.141 --> 00:37:49.310
I can prove it. And I've got Crystal.

337
00:37:49.311 --> 00:37:53.147
Crystal was knocked up with your kid and saw you playing happy family with Melissa.

338
00:37:53.148 --> 00:37:56.015
And she totally snapped.
-Wait. What?

339
00:37:57.361 --> 00:38:00.905
What'd you just say?
Crystal was pregnant with my kid?

340
00:38:00.906 --> 00:38:02.449
Yeah. with your baby.

341
00:38:03.033 --> 00:38:08.500
The kid she claimed she put up for adoption. No clue what she told you...

342
00:38:09.164 --> 00:38:11.897
but Crystal gave birth to a son.

343
00:38:13.001 --> 00:38:16.630
He's gotta be out there somewhere.
I'm sure you can track him down.

344
00:38:18.465 --> 00:38:22.665
I'll text you the address
of some public spot so we can talk.

345
00:38:23.512 --> 00:38:25.556
And then you're gonna leave me alone.

346
00:38:27.349 --> 00:38:30.769
You hear me?
You're gonna leave me and my family the hell alone.

347
00:38:32.312 --> 00:38:34.512
We didn't do any of this to you.

348
00:38:36.567 --> 00:38:38.902
Fine. Just send me the address.

349
00:39:07.723 --> 00:39:09.974
MAX. CRYSTAL. WHAT THE HELL IS THIS?

350
00:39:09.975 --> 00:39:12.144
MAKE SURE YOU GOT HER WHEN I GET THERE

351
00:39:16.857 --> 00:39:20.985
Is that your master plan? Handing me over to Max?
So he'll want you back?

352
00:39:20.986 --> 00:39:24.698
He wants you way more than me.
you toxic bitch.

353
00:39:27.534 --> 00:39:28.934
Move.

354
00:39:29.369 --> 00:39:33.331
Now what. Crys? How many times
do I gotta bail you out of your messes?

355
00:39:33.332 --> 00:39:35.791
I've got a plan. Shove her in the hold.

356
00:39:35.792 --> 00:39:37.502
No.
-Move.

357
00:39:37.503 --> 00:39:40.797
Throw her in. You gotta roll.
-Let's talk.

358
00:39:41.673 --> 00:39:43.073
Shut it.

359
00:39:51.350 --> 00:39:52.750
Get out of here.

360
00:39:54.520 --> 00:39:59.775
What were you gonna do if we hadn't shown up? Bash her over the head?

361
00:40:02.945 --> 00:40:04.345
Leave me alone.

362
00:40:12.246 --> 00:40:14.331
BATTERY 1%

363
00:40:20.963 --> 00:40:22.496
Don't hurt my son.

364
00:40:23.715 --> 00:40:26.844
Tom. untie yourself.

365
00:41:06.258 --> 00:41:09.802
I need some air.
I can barely breathe down here.

366
00:41:09.803 --> 00:41:11.403
Please?
-Ma'am?

367
00:41:18.103 --> 00:41:22.236
Whatever the Cadys promised you.
it ain't worth it.

368
00:41:24.234 --> 00:41:27.069
Watch what happens
if you keep running your mouth.

369
00:41:27.070 --> 00:41:30.740
Luke. do you want to spend the rest of your life locked up?

370
00:41:30.741 --> 00:41:34.541
It'd be a lot simpler if you just shut your trap. lady.

371
00:41:34.953 --> 00:41:36.455
Oh. my god.

372
00:41:43.629 --> 00:41:46.923
You good?
-Yeah. I'm fine.

373
00:41:46.924 --> 00:41:50.191
I've seen that scar before.
In your baby pictures.

374
00:41:52.429 --> 00:41:53.829
What?

375
00:41:57.100 --> 00:41:59.100
Does Max know you're his kid?

376
00:41:59.561 --> 00:42:00.978
What?
-That's total bullshit.

377
00:42:00.979 --> 00:42:04.398
I'm Crystal's kid.
-True. You're lying. bitch.

378
00:42:04.399 --> 00:42:07.360
Max Cady is your dad. Luke.
-She's lying.

379
00:42:07.361 --> 00:42:08.694
Shut up.

380
00:42:08.695 --> 00:42:10.571
Total BS.
-Why'd you say that?

381
00:42:10.572 --> 00:42:12.198
She's tripping.
-That bitch is lying.

382
00:42:12.199 --> 00:42:13.991
Max is my mom's brother.
-Yeah.

383
00:42:13.992 --> 00:42:17.453
Damn it.
-That bitch is lying. Shut her up. Luke.

384
00:42:17.454 --> 00:42:21.916
Yeah. but what about my dad?
-Your dad is who I said he was.

385
00:42:21.917 --> 00:42:26.128
He's a loser who bailed.
-She's lying. Can't you tell? Just look.

386
00:42:26.129 --> 00:42:30.132
Don't let her lie to you.
-It's how I said. Crys.

387
00:42:30.133 --> 00:42:32.969
The sins of the daughter
come back on the whole family.

388
00:42:32.970 --> 00:42:37.473
You're stressing yourself out. I can see it.
-Chill out. kid. or you're going in the cage.

389
00:42:37.474 --> 00:42:40.518
Am I going back in the cage?
To hell with your cage.

390
00:42:40.519 --> 00:42:44.230
Don't talk to your grandpa like that.
-Spit it out. Mom.

391
00:42:44.231 --> 00:42:47.316
I love you. I wouldn't hurt you.
-Don't...

392
00:42:47.317 --> 00:42:49.944
Don't say that.
-I would never hurt you.

393
00:42:49.945 --> 00:42:52.613
She's a stranger. I'm your mom.
-Spit it out.

394
00:42:52.614 --> 00:42:55.951
She can't handle the truth.
She's gaslighting herself.

395
00:42:56.076 --> 00:42:57.476
Shut your trap.

396
00:42:59.496 --> 00:43:00.896
Mom.

397
00:43:01.248 --> 00:43:02.666
Shut up.

398
00:43:06.670 --> 00:43:08.213
Drop dead. asshole.

399
00:43:09.756 --> 00:43:12.133
I hate you guys.

400
00:43:12.134 --> 00:43:14.677
Drop dead. asshole.
-Stop.

401
00:43:14.678 --> 00:43:16.470
You're gonna kill him.
-Let go.

402
00:43:16.471 --> 00:43:18.604
You lied to me.
-Stop.

403
00:43:19.057 --> 00:43:21.518
Don't.
-Why'd you lie?

404
00:43:26.023 --> 00:43:31.153
Drop dead.
Why'd you lie to me?

405
00:43:34.031 --> 00:43:36.783
Stop. you're killing him.
-Let go.

406
00:43:39.745 --> 00:43:41.288
You're gonna kill him.

407
00:43:43.832 --> 00:43:46.250
Chill.
-What am I even doing here?

408
00:43:46.251 --> 00:43:51.673
I wanna die. You're a trash mom.
